<% content_for :title, "Support - CocoScout" %>
<div class="min-h-screen bg-white">
  <!-- Header -->
  <div class="border-b border-slate-200 bg-white px-6 py-6">
    <div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-4xl items-center justify-between">
      <%= link_to root_path, class: "flex items-center gap-3" do %>
        <%= image_tag "/icon.png", alt: "CocoScout", class: "h-10 w-10" %>
        <span class="text-xl font-semibold coustard-regular text-pink-500">CocoScout</span>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 coustard-regular">Support</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-slate-700 mb-8">
      Stuck, or something not working? Email us and a person will write back.
    </p>

    <div class="mb-10 rounded-xl border border-pink-200 bg-pink-50 p-6">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-pink-700 mb-2">Email</p>
      <a href="mailto:support@cocoscout.com" class="text-2xl font-semibold text-pink-600 hover:text-pink-700 underline">support@cocoscout.com</a>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-3">
        Say which organization or show it's about and, if it's the app, which phone you're on. We answer every message, usually within a day.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-4">Common questions</h2>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2 mt-4">I can't sign in</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
          Use <%= link_to "Forgot password", password_path, class: "text-pink-600 hover:text-pink-700 underline" %> with the email your organization has for you. If no email arrives, check spam, then write to us and we'll sort it out.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2 mt-4">Where do I manage my organization?</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
          Casting, ticketing, payouts and everything else on the organization's side live on the web at <%= link_to "cocoscout.com", root_path, class: "text-pink-600 hover:text-pink-700 underline" %>. The CocoScout app, on iPhone and Android, is the performer side — your calendar, messages, sign-ups, contracts, pay and the door. A link to Manage from the app opens in your phone's browser.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2 mt-4">I'm not getting notifications on my phone</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
          Check that notifications are on for CocoScout in your phone's Settings (Notifications on iPhone, Apps on Android), and that you're signed in to the app with the same account your organization messages. A muted thread stays quiet on purpose; unmute it from the thread.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2 mt-4">Something's wrong with my tickets</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
          Tickets are sold by the organization putting on the show, and refunds follow its policy — the link in your order email reaches them directly. If the email never came, write to us with the name and date of the show.
        </p>

        <h3 id="delete-account" class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2 mt-4">How do I delete my account?</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
          In the CocoScout app or on the web, Account Settings → Delete my account files the request. We finish it within 30 days, and you can take it back until then.
          Can't sign in? Email <a href="mailto:privacy@cocoscout.com" class="text-pink-600 underline">privacy@cocoscout.com</a> from the address on the account and we'll do it for you.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
          Deleting removes your profile, headshots, messages and sign-ups. Payment and tax records that the law requires us to keep stay for as long as it requires, and nothing else.
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-slate-200">
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">
          How we handle your information is in the <%= link_to "Privacy Policy", privacy_path, class: "text-pink-600 hover:text-pink-700 underline" %>; the rules of the road are in the <%= link_to "Terms of Service", terms_path, class: "text-pink-600 hover:text-pink-700 underline" %>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer class="border-t border-slate-200 px-6 py-8 text-sm text-slate-500 bg-slate-50">
    <div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-4xl flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <p>&copy; <%= Time.current.year %> CocoScout. All rights reserved.</p>
      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <%= link_to "Terms of Service", terms_path, class: "hover:text-pink-600" %>
        <%= link_to "Privacy Policy", privacy_path, class: "hover:text-pink-600" %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</div>
